      "start_seconds": 9.55,
      "end_seconds": 20.76,
      "duration_seconds": 11.21,
      "text": "ah, honestly, it's hair loss on my shins, and my family pushed me to come my family kept telling me to get it checked"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 21.77,
      "end_seconds": 32.17,
      "duration_seconds": 10.4,
      "text": "Okay, so the vitals from earlier. Heart rate 64, temperature 36.7. Saturation 99 percent, respiratory rate 16, BP is 124 over 80."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 34.26,
      "end_seconds": 37.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "thanks did it it come on recently?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
