      "start_seconds": 217.81,
      "end_seconds": 220.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "What's on your current medicine list?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 221.41,
      "end_seconds": 231.61,
      "duration_seconds": 10.2,
      "text": "I, I take sitagliptin, 100 milligrams, once a day. I didn't want to make a fuss, you know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.07,
      "end_seconds": 237.96,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "Let me look at the area, I'll be gentle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 239.79,
      "end_seconds": 240.76,
      "duration_seconds": 0.97,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 242.45,
      "end_seconds": 243.91,
      "duration_seconds": 1.46,
      "text": "Nearly finished here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 260.37,
      "end_seconds": 267.41,
      "duration_seconds": 7.04,
      "text": "The pulses at the left foot are absent and the foot is cool and shiny."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 269.58,
      "end_seconds": 302.97,
      "duration_seconds": 33.39,
      "text": "That's the examination finished. A cholesterol test is what I'd like next, for arterial disease. I think an ankle-brachial index makes sense here, for claudication. I'm prescribing clopidogrel, 75 milligrams, once a day, long term. That's for arterial disease. The vascular clinic would be the right next step, I'll refer you. One warning sign to remember: the symptoms get worse. In that case don't wait. I'd like to see you again in four weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 304.08,
      "end_seconds": 309.11,
      "duration_seconds": 5.03,
      "text": "right, that's the plan do you want to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 310.32,
